      448.16,
      549.67,
      511.23
    ],
    "text": "(b) Risk allowance for handling safe keys- E\ufb00 ective from 01/01/2025. Details are as follows: The maximum amount payable for one class of safe keys is Rs. 150/ per day irrespective of the number of o\ufb03 cers handling the same key for a given day. (Example- if two o\ufb03 cers handle the safe key in a day, each o\ufb03 cer is entitled for Rs.75/- each per day.)",
