    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      242.97,
      241.46,
      254.04
    ],
    "text": "4. Date Of Operation And Duration.\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      266.97,
      549.67,
      334.04
    ],
    "text": "4.1 This Agreement shall be in force from 1st day of January Two Thousand and Twenty-four (01-01-2024) and shall continue until either party terminates it by written notice in terms of the Industrial Disputes Act, as amended. However, no party shall give such notice to the other party before the thirty \ufb01 rst (31st) day of December Two Thousand and Twenty-six (3lst December 2026). The Union shall, however, have the right to commence negotiations for a revised Collective Agreement after 1st April 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      348.97,
      455.66,
      360.04
    ],
    "text": "5. Matters Covered and Variation of Terms and Conditions of Employment and Bene\ufb01 ts.\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      372.97,
      549.68,
      440.04
    ],
    "text": "5.1 This Agreement shall be in full and \ufb01 nal settlement of all matters covered herein as well as of all the matters which are covered by this agreement and in respect of which negotiations took place between the parties before the conclusion of this Agreement and the Union agrees that it will not during the continuance in force of this agreement raise any of the matters which were discussed and negotiated between the parties preceding this agreement.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      452.97,
      549.68,
      492.04
    ],
    "text": "5.2 It is agreed by the parties covered and bound by this Agreement that they shall not during the continuance in force of this Agreement seek to vary, alter, or add to all or any of the terms and conditions of employment or bene\ufb01 ts presently applicable or enjoyed as provided in this Agreement other than by mutual agreement.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      506.97,
      173.22,
      518.04
    ],
    "text": "6. Salary Structure.\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      530.97,
      549.67,
      556.04
    ],
    "text": "6.1 As from First day of January Two thousand and Twenty-Four (1st January 2024) each employee covered and bound by this Agreement shall be paid and subject to other terms and conditions herein contained.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      570.97,
      232.57,
      582.04
    ],
    "text": "7. Conversion of the Basic Salary.\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      594.97,
      549.67,
      620.04
    ],
    "text": "7.1 The Basic Salaries of all employees will be converted to the revised salaries by applying the revision by step for step (point by point) method of conversion.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      632.97,
      530.48,
      644.04
    ],
    "text": "7.2 Non-banking stream personnel shall also be placed at the appropriate revised salary on the same basis.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      658.97,
      188.78,
      670.04
    ],
    "text": "8. Other Commitments.\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      680.97,
      549.68,
      720.04
    ],
    "text": "8.1 The Union further agrees to assist, cooperate, and support the management of the bank in every manner to obtain the maximum contribution of its members to achieve the targets set out in the Business plan of the Bank.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      734.97,
      547.18,
      760.04
    ],
    "text": "8.2 The Union and its members covered and bound by this agreement jointly and severally agree with the Bank that during the continuous in force of this agreement they shall not engage in any strike or other form of",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      96.27,
      84.69,
      491.47,
